# Copy this file to .env (already gitignored -- your real key never gets
# committed) and fill in a real key. Only needed for commands that call the
# Anthropic API: `auto_audit.py` / `dpa.py auto-audit`, and
# `record.py --auto-audit`. Every other command (record, extract-evidence,
# run-attributes, build-output, report, build-payload, ...) is free, local
# computation and needs no key at all.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# python-dotenv loads this automatically from the project root -- no shell
# export needed. If you'd rather not use a .env file, `export
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...` in your shell works exactly the same way.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
